professional-skill-piloting-level-0 = Read navigation consoles; controls are unavailable.
professional-skill-piloting-level-1 = Pilot the ship in Drive mode. Brake, Stop and Cruise modes are unavailable.
professional-skill-piloting-level-2 = Full controls, braking and all movement modes.
professional-skill-piloting-level-3 = Full controls; an 80% chance to avoid collision consequences.
professional-skill-shooting-level-0 = Toy and practice guns, magic staves, spray nozzles, mail launchers, flare guns and holoflares. An extra 5° of spread and a 10% random-direction shot chance.
professional-skill-shooting-level-1 = Pistols, revolvers, ordinary lasers, laser repeaters, energy SMGs, handmade shotguns, stun guns and PKAs. This tier has an extra 5° of spread and a 10% random-direction shot chance. Earlier tiers have no skill penalties. Reload ship turrets.
professional-skill-shooting-level-2 = Nonautomatic rifles, including the Gestio, shotguns, including energy shotguns, pulse weapons, laser and X-ray cannons, and the turbo laser. This tier has an extra 5° of spread and a 10% random-direction shot chance. Earlier tiers have no skill penalties.
professional-skill-shooting-level-3 = Automatic weapons, including the Bulldog, with an extra 5° of spread and no random-direction shots. Earlier tiers have no skill penalties.
professional-skill-shooting-level-4 = Machine guns, grenade launchers, the M203 and ship gunnery. All weapons without skill penalties.
professional-skills-gunnery-required = Shooting level 4 is required to control weapons. You can still view the console.
professional-skill-medicine-level-0 = Ointment, bandages, blood packs and basic first aid. Medipen injections take 3 seconds, including self-injection.
professional-skill-medicine-level-1 = Syringes, medipens without the extra skill delay, sutures, regenerative mesh and health analyzers. No hyposprays yet.
professional-skill-medicine-level-2 = Hyposprays and basic surgery: incisions, disinfection, suturing, amputations and glass removal. Treatments heal 15% more.
professional-skill-medicine-level-3 = Advanced medicine: full surgery, organs and implants. Apply treatments 15% faster.
professional-skill-medicine-level-4 = Chemistry equipment, reagent identification and cloning. 15% less contamination introduced during surgery; equipment still needs sterilization. All previous benefits.
professional-skill-engineering-level-0 = Basic tools are available but slower. Instant tool actions take 5 seconds.
professional-skill-engineering-level-1 = Advanced tools, door hacking, AME controls and refueling, and construction of structures, AMEs and TEGs. Everyday item crafting remains unrestricted.
professional-skill-engineering-level-2 = RCDs and atmospherics: pipes, canisters, vents and scrubbers.
professional-skill-engineering-level-3 = Build and service Tesla, singularity, containment fields, emitters and particle accelerators.
professional-skill-salvage-level-0 = Pickaxes, ordinary and bluespace ore bags, and civilian ore processors. Grappling guns have an 80% random-direction misfire chance.
professional-skill-salvage-level-1 = Ordinary and diamond drills, basic and advanced mineral scanners, and ore crates. No grappling gun penalty. PKAs require shooting 1.
professional-skill-salvage-level-2 = Crushers, glaives and standard ore processors. All previous abilities.
professional-skill-salvage-level-3 = Pilot Clarke mechs and use industrial ore processors. All previous abilities.
professional-skill-botany-level-0 = Cannot plant, harvest, tend or water trays and soil. Inspection remains available.
professional-skill-botany-level-1 = Planting, harvesting, watering, fertilizers and gardening tools. No seed extractor or plant analyzer yet.
professional-skill-botany-level-2 = Seed extractors, plant analyzers and all previous abilities.
professional-skill-botany-level-3 = Detailed analysis, Left-4-Zed and unstable mutagen for breeding.
professional-skill-cooking-level-0 = Consume food and drinks. Cooking is unavailable.
professional-skill-cooking-level-1 = Microwave, oven and assembler recipes with 1-2 ingredient types. Simple drinks and coffee.
professional-skill-cooking-level-2 = Dishes with 3-4 ingredient types and cocktails with 2-3 reagents.
professional-skill-cooking-level-3 = All dishes and drinks, including complex recipes.
professional-skill-science-level-0 = Read previously collected data. No new scans or experiments.
professional-skill-science-level-1 = Study blueprints at the research console.
professional-skill-science-level-2 = Artifact analysis consoles, scanning and activation. The A.P.E. remains available without this tier.
professional-skill-science-level-3 = Anomaly scanners, C.H.I.M.P. particle pistols, anomaly generation and advanced research.
professional-skills-unknown-reagent = Unknown substance
professional-skills-botany-failure = You failed to tend the plant correctly.
